:{"description":"话题 ID（omt_xxx 格式）","type":"string"},"sort_rule":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"排序方式，默认 create_time_desc（最新消息在前）"},"page_size":{"description":"每页消息数（1-50），默认 50","minimum":1,"maximum":50,"type":"number"}}}},{"name":"feishu_im_user_message","description":"飞书用户身份 IM 消息工具。**有且仅当用户明确要求以自己身份发消息、回复消息时使用，当没有明确要求时优先使用message系统工具**。\n\nActions:\n- send（发送消息）：发送消息到私聊或群聊。私聊用 receive_id_type=open_id，群聊用 receive_id_type=chat_id\n- reply（回复消息）：回复指定 message_id 的消息，支持话题回复（reply_in_thread=true）\n\n【重要】content 必须是合法 JSON 字符串，格式取决于 msg_type。最常用：text 类型 content 为 '{\"text\":\"消息内容\"}'。\n\n【安全约束】此工具以用户身份发送消息，发出后对方看到的发送者是用户本人。调用前必须先向用户确认：1) 发送对象（哪个人或哪个群）2) 消息内容。禁止在用户未明确同意的情况下自行发送消息。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"receive_id_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"接收者 ID 类型：open_id（私聊，ou_xxx）、chat_id（群聊，oc_xxx）"},"receive_id":{"description":"接收者 ID，与 receive_id_type 对应。open_id 填 'ou_xxx'，chat_id 填 'oc_xxx'","type":"string"},"msg_type":{"description":"消息类型：text（纯文本）、post（富文本）、image（图片）、file（文件）、interactive（消息卡片）、share_chat（群名片）、share_user（个人名片）等","type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"content":{"description":"消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。示例：text → '{\"text\":\"你好\"}'，image → '{\"image_key\":\"img_xxx\"}'，share_chat → '{\"chat_id\":\"oc_xxx\"}'，post → '{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}'","type":"string"},"uuid":{"description":"幂等唯一标识。同一 uuid 在 1 小时内只会发送一条消息，用于去重","type":"string"},"message_id":{"description":"被回复消息的 ID（om_xxx 格式）","type":"string"},"reply_in_thread":{"description":"是否以话题形式回复。true 则消息出现在该消息的话题中，false（默认）则出现在聊天主流","type":"boolean"}},"required":["action","msg_type","content"],"additionalProperties":true}},{"name":"feishu_im_user_search_messages","description":"【以用户身份】跨会话搜索飞书消息。\n\n用法：\n- 按关键词搜索消息内容\n- 按发送者、被@用户、消息类型过滤\n- 按时间范围过滤：relative_time 或 start_time/end_time\n- 限定在某个会话内搜索（chat_id）\n- 支持分页：page_size + page_token\n\n【参数约束】\n- 所有参数均可选，但至少应提供一个过滤条件\n- relative_time 和 start_time/end_time 不能同时使用\n- page_size 范围 1-50，默认 50\n\n返回消息列表，每条消息包含 message_id、msg_type、content、sender、create_time 等字段。\n每条消息还包含 chat_id、chat_type（p2p/group）、chat_name（群名或单聊对方名字）。\n单聊消息额外包含 chat_partner（对方 open_id 和名字）。\n搜索结果中的 chat_id 和 thread_id 可配合 feishu_im_user_get_messages / feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages 查看上下文。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"搜索关键词，匹配消息内容。可为空字符串表示不按内容过滤","type":"string"},"sender_ids":{"description":"发送者 open_id 列表。如需根据用户名查找 open_id，请先使用 search_user 工具","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"chat_id":{"description":"限定搜索范围的会话 ID（oc_xxx）","type":"string"},"mention_ids":{"description":"被@用户的 open_id 列表","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"message_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"消息类型过滤：file / image / media。为空则搜索所有类型"},"sender_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"发送者类型：user / bot / all。默认 user"},"chat_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"会话类型：group（群聊）/ p2p（单聊）"},"relative_time":{"description":"相对时间范围：today / yesterday / day_before_yesterday / this_week / last_week / this_month / last_month / last_{N}_{unit}（unit: minutes/hours/days）。与 start_time/end_time 互斥","type":"string"},"start_time":{"description":"起始时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T00:00:00+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"},"end_time":{"description":"结束时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T23:59:59+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"},"page_size":{"description":"每页消息数（1-50），默认 50","minimum":1,"maximum":50,"type":"number"}}}},{"name":"feishu_oauth","description":"飞书用户撤销授权工具。仅在用户明确说\"撤销授权\"、\"取消授权\"、\"退出登录\"、\"清除授权\"时调用 revoke。【严禁调用场景】用户说\"重新授权\"、\"发起授权\"、\"重新发起\"、\"授权失败\"、\"授权过期\"时，绝对不要调用此工具，授权流程由系统自动处理，无需人工干预。不需要传入 user_open_id，系统自动从消息上下文获取当前用户。","parameters":{"description":"飞书用户撤销授权工具。仅在用户明确说\"撤销授权\"、\"取消授权\"、\"退出登录\"、\"清除授权\"时调用。【严禁调用场景】用户说\"重新授权\"、\"发起授权\"、\"重新发起\"、\"授权失败\"、\"授权过期\"时，绝对不要调用此工具，授权流程由系统自动处理。","type":"object","required":["action"],"properties":{"action":{"description":"revoke: 撤销当前用户已保存的授权凭据","const":"revoke","type":"string"}}}},{"name":"feishu_oauth_batch_auth","description":"飞书批量授权工具，一次性授权应用已开通的所有用户权限。仅在用户明确要求'授权所有权限'、'一次性授权'时使用。","parameters":{"description":"飞书批量授权工具。一次性授权应用已开通的所有用户权限（User Access Token scope）。【使用场景】用户明确要求'授权所有权限'、'一次性授权完成'时使用。【重要】禁止主动推荐此工具，仅在用户明确要求时使用。","type":"object","properties":{}}},{"name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","description":"【以用户身份】飞书文档与 Wiki 统一搜索工具。同时搜索云空间文档和知识库 Wiki。Actions: search。【重要】query 参数是搜索关键词（必填），filter 参数可选。【重要】filter 不传时，搜索所有文档和 Wiki；传了则同时对文档和 Wiki 应用相同的过滤条件。【重要】支持按文档类型、创建者、创建时间、打开时间等多维度筛选。【重要】返回结果包含标题和摘要高亮（<h>标签包裹匹配关键词）。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["action"],"properties":{"action":{"const":"search","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"搜索关键词（可选）。不传或传空字符串表示空搜，也可以支持排序规则与筛选，默认根据最近浏览时间返回结果","maxLength":50,"type":"string"},"filter":{"description":"搜索过滤条件（可选）。不传则搜索所有文档和 Wiki；传了则同时对文档和 Wiki 应用相同的过滤条件。","type":"object","properties":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"page_size":{"description":"分页大小（默认 15，最大 20）","minimum":0,"maximum":20,"type":"integer"}}}},{"name":"feishu_search_user","description":"搜索员工信息（通过关键词搜索姓名、手机号、邮箱）。返回匹配的员工列表，包含姓名、部门、open_id 等信息。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["query"],"properties":{"query":{"description":"搜索关键词，用于匹配用户名（必填）","type":"string"},"page_size":{"description":"分页大小，控制每次返回的用户数量（默认20，最大200）","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"type":"integer"}}}},{"name":"feishu_sheet","description":"【以用户身份】飞书电子表格工具。支持创建、读写、查找、导出电子表格。\n\n电子表格（Sheets）类似 Excel/Google Sheets，与多维表格（Bitable/Airtable）是不同产品。\n\n所有 action（除 create 外）均支持传入 url 或 spreadsheet_token，工具会自动解析。支持知识库 wiki URL，自动解析为电子表格 token。\n\nActions:\n- info：获取表格信息 + 全部工作表列表（一次调用替代 get_info + list_sheets）\n- read：读取数据。不填 range 自动读取第一个工作表全部数据\n- write：覆盖写入,高危,请谨慎使用该操作。不填 range 自动写入第一个工作表（从 A1 开始）\n- append：在已有数据末尾追加行\n- find：在工作表中查找单元格\n- create：创建电子表格。支持带 headers + data 一步创建含数据的表格\n- export：导出为 xlsx 或 csv（csv 必须指定 sheet_id）","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"url":{"description":"电子表格 URL，例如 https://xxx.feishu.cn/sheets/TOKEN 或 https://xxx.feishu.cn/wiki/TOKEN（与 spreadsheet_token 二选一）","type":"string"},"range":{"description":"读取范围（可选）。格式：<sheetId>!A1:D10 或 <sheetId>（sheetId 通过 info 获取）。不填则自动读取第一个工作表全部数据","type":"string"},"sheet_id":{"description":"工作表 ID（可选）。仅当不提供 range 时生效，指定要读取的工作表。不填则读取第一个工作表","type":"string"},"value_render_option":{"description":"值渲染方式：ToString（默认）、FormattedValue（按格式）、Formula（公式）、UnformattedValue（原始值）","anyOf":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"values":{"description":"二维数组，每个元素是一行。例如 [[\"姓名\",\"年龄\"],[\"张三\",25]]","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"find":{"description":"查找内容（字符串或正则表达式）","type":"string"},"match_case":{"description":"是否区分大小写（默认 true）","type":"boolean"},"match_entire_cell":{"description":"是否完全匹配整个单元格（默认 false）","type":"boolean"},"search_by_regex":{"description":"是否使用正则表达式（默认 false）","type":"boolean"},"include_formulas":{"description":"是否搜索公式（默认 false）","type":"boolean"},"title":{"description":"电子表格标题","type":"string"},"headers":{"description":"表头列名（可选）。例如 [\"姓名\", \"部门\", \"入职日期\"]。提供后会写入第一行","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"data":{"description":"初始数据（可选）。二维数组，写在表头之后。例如 [[\"张三\", \"工程\", \"2026-01-01\"]]","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"file_extension":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"导出格式：xlsx 或 csv"},"output_path":{"description":"本地保存路径（含文件名）。不填则只返回文件信息","type":"string"}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":true}},{"name":"feishu_task_agent","description":"飞书任务 Agent 注册管理工具。用于注册/取消注册 Task Agent，以及查询已注册列表。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"profile_content":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":true}},{"name":"feishu_task_attachment","description":"飞书任务附件工具。当前提供 upload action，用于上传任务附件。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["action","resource_id","file"],"properties":{"action":{"const":"upload","type":"string"},"resource_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"资源类型，可选值：task、task_delivery。默认 task。","default":"task"},"resource_id":{"description":"资源 ID。","type":"string"},"file":{"description":"文件内容base64编码字符串","type":"string"},"name":{"description":"文件名。","type":"string"}}}},{"name":"feishu_task_comment","description":"【以用户或应用身份】飞书任务评论管理工具。当用户要求添加/查询任务评论、回复评论时使用。Actions: create（添加评论）, list（列出任务的所有评论）, get（获取单个评论详情）。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"auth_type":{"description":"调用 API 时使用的 Token 类型。可选值：\"tenant\"（应用身份） 或 \"user\"（用户身份）。默认使用 \"user\"。","type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"task_guid":{"description":"任务 GUID","type":"string"},"content":{"description":"评论内容（纯文本，最长 3000 字符）","type":"string"},"reply_to_comment_id":{"description":"要回复的评论 ID（用于回复评论）","type":"string"},"resource_id":{"description":"要获取评论的资源 ID（任务 GUID）","type":"s