oduct entry and human oversight.\n","thinkingSignature":"0e2db2e85326e543a8222bff600e1bf7311d980bd76e40e02f4407ebead04de7"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n抱歉，记忆系统确实没同步到位。越南 VN 发饰是主营类目，这条我记住了。\n\n你说的对，SOP 那套卡死 70% 毛利的逻辑太僵了——把潜力款全拦掉了。策略需要改。\n\n**新策略框架：**\n\n**前期（人工筛选阶段）：**\n- 放宽毛利门槛 → 先让产品进来\n- 我扫描候选池，你人工过筛子\n- 重点看：增长趋势、销量基础、竞争烈度\n- 毛利参考指标，不是硬卡线\n\n**后期利润来源：**\n- 拓品（扩产品线）\n- 组合品（套装捆绑）\n- SKU 改造（变体扩展）\n- 合作互补产品（找供应链互补的品）\n\n这样利润是从结构里做出来的，不是在选品那一刻卡死的。\n\n**现在要做的：**\n1. 更新 SOP v7.0 → 新 SOP v8.0（放宽毛利，标注人工审核）\n2. 这次选品先给你过一遍，不直接写多维表\n\n现在开扫越南发饰，先跑一轮候选池出来，你来人工挑？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":57932,"output":400,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58332,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781354121377,"responseId":"067c81893a3f710efc30f6fb0e5370af"},{"role":"user","content":"你 先说怎么改","timestamp":1781356551388},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pushing back on the rigid SOP and wants a more dynamic approach. They're saying:\n\n1. A single price adjustment won't work\n2. Need a dynamic \"algorithm\" mechanism for selecting potential profit products\n3. Can't completely lock down profit margins\n4. Let products in first, human reviews the selected products early stage\n5. Later profit comes from: expanding product range, bundle combos, SKU improvements, complementary products\n\nThey're asking me to first explain how to change the SOP/strategy.\n\nLet me think about what a dynamic mechanism would look like:\n\n**Current v7.0 rigid approach:**\n- Hard cutoff: price ≥ $3.0 AND margin ≥ 70%\n- Any product not meeting both = discarded\n\n\n- \n**Dynamic approach I'm thinking through:**\n- Use multiple signals like Shopee monthly sales, 7-day momentum, rating, review count, TikTok trend data, and 1688 cost to create a composite \"potential score\" instead of binary pass/fail\n- Tier products into categories like S/A/