n产品同时满足以下条件时，**毛利门槛可下调**：\n\n- 增长率 >30% → 可接受毛利 20%+\n- TikTok 有同款在跑 → 可接受毛利 25%+\n- 竞争度低（卖家数少） → 可接受毛利 25%+\n\n三个条件叠加，最低可接受毛利到 15%（纯跑量款）。\n\n---\n\n### 后期利润结构\n\n```\n单品毛利（基准）\n    ↓ 组合套装 → +10-20%\n    ↓ SKU变体扩展 → +5-15%\n    ↓ 拓品线 → +10-30%\n    ↓ 合作互补产品 → 整体利润率提升\n    ↓\n整体利润结构\n```\n\n选品只解决\"产品能卖\"，利润靠后端结构做出来。\n\n---\n\n### Cron执行策略\n\n| 阶段 | 执行方式 |\n|------|---------|\n| 前期（现在） | 扫描 → 候选池 → 飞书给你推送 → 你人工审核 |\n| 后期（稳定后） | 扫描 → 候选池 → 人工标记 → 授权后自动写多维表 |\n\n候选池暂存，推送给你的格式支持快速人工过筛。\n\n---\n\n**确认这个框架后，我来做两件事：**\n\n1. 更新 SOP v8.0 文档\n2. 这次选品先跑一轮候选池，推给你审核\n\n框架有没有要调整的？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":58428,"output":898,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59326,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781358884935,"responseId":"067c9425a1fa6b969f21964c6929e2c0"},{"role":"user","content":"毛利70%硬卡 调整这个，先让数据进来。","timestamp":1781359341946},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Adjust the SOP - remove the 70% gross margin hard stop\n2. Let more data/products come in first\n3. Test and iterate\n\nThey're saying \"试\" - test it out, try it. Only through multiple attempts can we find the right direction.\n\nThey specifically said: \"毛利70%硬卡 调整这个，先让数据进来。\" - Adjust the 70% gross margin hard stop, let the data come in first.\n\nSo I should:\n1. Update the SOP v7.0 to remove the 70% hard stop\n2. Start scanning Vietnam hair accessories with the new relaxed criteria\n3. Show results to user for manual review before writing to Feishu\n\n\n4. Now I'm going to adjust the SOP and begin scanning for Vietnam hair accessories with the revised approach.","thinkingSignature":"348c74ba695740b8bd55829f13ec229225f7c877b34c42472323d31753d89840"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好，立即改，立即扫。\n\n先更新 SOP，把 70% 硬卡拿掉：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c15667422b3a4e03a16fa7e6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/halei/workspace